    "title": "Nested-tensor scaled dot-product attention disagrees with dense attention under CUDA autocast",
    "body": "With CUDA float16 autocast and mixed float32/float16 inputs, scaled_dot_product_attention on jagged nested tensors does not follow the same dtype and numerical behavior as the equivalent dense call. Nested and dense results and gradients must agree in eager and compiled execution under autocast.",
